# BotOS local environment template.
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in real values there:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Rules:
#   - This file lists variable NAMES and placeholder values only.
#   - Never put a real credential here. `make verify` fails the build if a
#     variable in this file carries a populated value.
#   - Every variable the code reads must be listed here, with a comment
#     explaining what it is and whether it is required.
#
# No application code exists yet, so no variables are consumed today. When you
# add the first one, follow this shape:
#
#   # Required. Postgres connection string for the primary datastore.
#   DATABASE_URL=<placeholder>
